	(descr "TDK SPM10065VC-D series 68uH power inductor, 10.5 x 10.0 x 6.5 mm. Land geometry taken from the vendor recommended land pattern: pad width A=2.95 mm, inner gap B=6.10 mm, pad depth C=4.50 mm. The vendor also draws a 12.0 mm outer envelope and a 4.2 +/-0.2 mm dimension on the 4/4 page; A is reproduced exactly by (12.0 - 6.10)/2 = 2.95, so the envelope is read as the pad outer-edge span and B as the inner gap.")
